  "title": "Basque Cheesecake",
  "description": "This show-stopping Basque cheesecake from Chef John bakes the cheesecake in a very hot oven for a beautiful dark exterior, creamy and silky inside.",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
  "date_published": "2019-02-19T23:16:41-05:00",
